\nModelize Home enables you to explore immersive spaces created from your floor plans or property models, ensuring your vision is communicated effectively and managed seamlessly. Available on any device, Modelize Home allows you to access your projects wherever you are, empowering you to make decisions on the go.\n \nUse Modelize Home to:\n \n\u2022\tExplore immersive virtual spaces: See your future home come to life in walkable, clickable and dollhouse views.\n\u2022\tCollaborate and review: Make design reviews a breeze with real-time, in-experience, design review tools.\n\u2022\tShare your experience: Instantly share your space with family, friends and contractors so they can better understand your future home.\n\u2022\tPresent your space: Easily connect with local and international clients in public and guided viewing sessions. \n\nStep into a new era of property visualization with Modelize Home and transform how you interact with unbuilt property.", "short_description": "Explore unbuilt property in 1:1 scale using the latest 3D, VR technology."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.3dmodelize.com/modelize-privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.3dmodelize.com/modelizetermsofuse", "publisher_name": "3D Modelize", "support_website_url": "https://www.3dmodelize.com/contact", "website_url": "https://www.3dmodelize.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1819021644882647"}, {"id": "1063584910766706"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH", "HAND_TRACKING"], "supported_player_modes": ["STA